point_alternative: a delta at the subradar point gives 100% in each listed positive delay/frequency rectangle; it suppresses all distributed delay/Doppler tails and is not an empirical lunar profile
falsifier: a time-tagged coded echo or independently referenced CW spectrum across multiple lunar pointings/epochs should test joint (delay, differential Doppler) occupancy; if no coupling survives after exact geometry/beam normalization, retain factorized marginals
